{"4300010":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Pick 'N Punch: The Broken World","steam_appid":4300010,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long story short: two bros, one goes bad and wrecks the world. The other<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >stays good and tries to save it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick ‘n Punch is a tough 2D physics platformer where you climb, and climb<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more, and then climb even more, just to climb some more and fall again,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >repeating the whole thing until you give up. Don’t worry, the character will<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >keep yapping to give you company. Just not with nice words.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get tired of climbing, this guy has other powers, too.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4300010\/extras\/3a5ce1098c7ad43b50bf3b54c2e85fd7.poster.avif?t=1777712661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4300010\/extras\/3a5ce1098c7ad43b50bf3b54c2e85fd7.mp4?t=1777712661\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want something more while falling? This gives you a little extra time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4300010\/extras\/566f8a872e47b065a92c56852c209e77.poster.avif?t=1777712661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4300010\/extras\/566f8a872e47b065a92c56852c209e77.mp4?t=1777712661\"